<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-2185] ParquetReader constructed using builder fails to read encrypted files</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2185</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;ParquetReader objects can be constructed using the builder as follows:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
ParquetReader&amp;lt;Group&amp;gt; builderReader = ParquetReader.builder(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; GroupReadSupport(),&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; Path(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;path/to/c000.snappy.parquet&quot;&lt;/span&gt;))
.withConf(conf)
.build();
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This parquetReader object cannot be used to read encrypted files as&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;builderReader.read()&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;fails with the following exception:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
java.lang.NullPointerException at org.apache.parquet.crypto.keytools.FileKeyUnwrapper.getKey(FileKeyUnwrapper.java:87) &#160;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It seems like the reason is that the &lt;em&gt;withConf&lt;/em&gt; method within the ParquetReader builder &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/blob/master/parquet-hadoop/src/main/java/org/apache/parquet/hadoop/ParquetReader.java#L231&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;clears the optionsBuilder set earlier&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here is a sample test showcasing the issue: &lt;a href=&quot;https://gist.github.com/a2l007/3d813cc5e44c45100dda169dc6245ae4&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://gist.github.com/a2l007/3d813cc5e44c45100dda169dc6245ae4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
